<title>PHILIPPINES: ADB cuts lending rate on dollar loans.</title>
<headline>ADB cuts lending rate on dollar loans.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Asian Development Bank (ADB) said on Thursday it had lowered its lending rate on U.S. dollar loans to 6.79 percent per annum from 6.82 percent effective January 1.</p>
<p>However, its lending rate on multi-currency loans remained at 6.0 percent per year, the bank said in a statement.</p>
</text>
